^SERIES = GSE115389
!Series_title = RNA-Seq analysis of HIF-2a-responsive genes in clear-cell renal cell carcinoma
!Series_geo_accession = GSE115389
!Series_status = Public on Mar 04 2019
!Series_submission_date = Jun 05 2018
!Series_last_update_date = Apr 17 2019
!Series_pubmed_id = 30962421
!Series_summary = We performed RNA-Seq analysis of wildtype and three EPAS1-/- 786-O single cell clones generated by CRISPR/Cas9 to identify the HIF-2a-responsive genes in this cell line. Samples from wildtype 786-O cells treated with DMSO or HIF-2a antagonist compound C2 were also included in this analysis.
!Series_overall_design = In this experiment, we analyzed the transcriptomic profiles of 2 replicates of wildtype (WT) EPAS1+/+ 786-O cells, 1 replicate for each of the three independent EPAS1-/- 786-O single cell clones, 1 replicate of WT-786-O cells treated with DMSO and 1 replicate of WT-786-O cells treated with 10uM HIF-2a antagonist C2.
!Series_type = Expression profiling by high throughput sequencing
